{
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "background",
      "title": "项目背景",
      "type": "text",
      "paragraphs": {
        "zh": [
          "我们正在打造 Copilot macOS UI Kit，在 Copilot 核心设计系统的基础上，补充适用于 macOS 的基础规范，包括字体排版、层级与阴影、材质效果、图标体系，以及 16 个关键组件。",
          "这套 UI Kit 为设计与研发建立统一基础，提高效率、加快迭代，并加强与工程团队的协作，帮助交付一致、高质量的代码。",
          "面向未来，它也为后续功能的扩展奠定基础，让 Copilot 在保持跨平台一致性的同时，呈现自然、原生的 macOS 体验。"
        ],
        "en": [
          "We are building the Copilot macOS UI Kit to extend the core Copilot Design System with macOS-specific fundamentals—typography, elevation, materials, iconography—and 16 key components.",
          "This kit creates a shared foundation that improves efficiency, accelerates iteration, and strengthens collaboration with engineering to deliver a consistent, high-quality code base.",
          "Looking ahead, it also sets the stage for scaling future features with confidence and ensuring Copilot continues to feel both native to macOS and cohesive across platforms."
        ]
      }
    },
